rop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=505b73e5239ad641246f9056483551f7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fc0e1586/uploads/origins/f14f6a52-917c-4ece-bef1-1a3c271f2a0d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13b181d6af6eda96496608e8a3d7c137 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私のキャラクター（女性）を描いてくれませんか？ 得意な衣装や好みの衣装を自由に選んでください！または、「1.初期設定。'/'3.その他の衣装'\n小柄でハムスターのような小さなロボット少女で、おちゃめで空気を読まない性格。\nヤミカワ系が好きで、ペンギム、ワイヤー、円盤、ハイテク系など、参考にしていただけるモチーフです。\n報酬が足りない場合は、再送をお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jo5UxYnbjUfiB3E6E4tMamKn2mqT1IOW?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rnatataki/works/200", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/53bf78a9/uploads/origins/b548b5a2-27c5-4c03-809d-4b481a588b9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d910aa00b2b6102c3dd6bb5f5f9d7e2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/53bf78a9/uploads/origins/b548b5a2-27c5-4c03-809d-4b481a588b9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d910aa00b2b6102c3dd6bb5f5f9d7e2, https://si.imgix.net/53bf78a9/uploads/origins/b548b5a2-27c5-4c03-809d-4b481a588b9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=714cee7acf21370d547398ea0409e87f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/53bf78a9/uploads/origins/b548b5a2-27c5-4c03-809d-4b481a588b9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6233bd79cb055fe7d1a77e518629642 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "i'd like to create my oc with your help. it's my first ever time commissioning an artist, especially through skeb. i don't have a lot of requests and let you almost full liberty on the art. i would just like a white woman, with pale/white skin, grey/white hair, white eyes and only wearing greyscale clothes. and if she could do a peace sign with her left hand it would be awesome ! thank you", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rnatataki/works/199", "thumbnail_src"